# Config-only repo. Ignore everything, then re-include just the files we
# authored or modified. Notes never get tracked; neither does stock or
# third-party config (themes, app.json, graph.json, workspace.json).

/*
!.gitignore
!README.md

!.obsidian/
.obsidian/*

# Modified by us: accent colour + enabled snippets
!.obsidian/appearance.json
# Modified by us: slash-command turned on
!.obsidian/core-plugins.json
# Modified by us: enables the text-color plugin
!.obsidian/community-plugins.json

# Added by us
!.obsidian/hotkeys.json
!.obsidian/snippets/

!.obsidian/plugins/
.obsidian/plugins/*
!.obsidian/plugins/text-color/
# Plugin settings files can hold API keys
.obsidian/plugins/text-color/data.json
